OL,4,BHibs boss Reedijk rejects talk of      
OL,5,BEaster Road jinx                       
OL,6,GManager Marink Reedijk has rejected    
OL,7,Gsuggestions Easter Road is jinxed      
OL,8,Gdespite Hibernian being without a home 
OL,9,Gwin in the Scottish Premiership for    
OL,10,Gmore than seven months.                
OL,12,FHibs have lost nine of their last 10   
OL,13,Fhome league games, with the 3-0        
OL,14,Fvictory against Kilmarnock on 4 April  
OL,15,Funder former manager David Gray the    
OL,16,Flast success in the Premiership in     
OL,17,Ffront of their own fans.               
